msgstr "I-export ang mga setting"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:893
msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Ibalik sa mga default"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:894
msgid "This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?"
msgstr "Ibabalik nito sa default ang bawat setting sa plugin na ito. Magpatuloy?"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:901
msgid "Diagnostics for support"
msgstr "Diagnostics para sa suporta"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:910
msgid "Import a settings file"
msgstr "Mag-import ng file ng mga setting"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:912
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Mag-import"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:914
msgid "Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site."
msgstr "Ang mga naka-export na file ay hindi kailanman naglalaman ng mga password, token o API key — kakailanganin mong ilagay muli ang mga iyon sa bagong site."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1013
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Na-save na ang mga setting."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1060
msgid "Every setting on this plugin is back to its default."
msgstr "Naibalik na sa dati ang bawat setting sa plugin na ito."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1103
msgid "Done."
msgstr "Tapos na."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1107
msgid "That action is not available."
msgstr "Hindi available ang pagkilos na iyon."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1174
msgid "That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin."
msgstr "Hindi nabasa ang file na iyon. Pumili ng file ng mga setting na na-export mula sa isang Zinn® plugin."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1182
msgid "That file is too large to be a settings export."
msgstr "Napakalaki ng file na iyon para maging isang export ng mga setting."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1195
msgid "That file is not a Zinn® settings export."
msgstr "Hindi galing sa Zinn® settings export ang file na iyon."

#. translators: %s: the plugin slug the file was exported from.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1203
#, php-format
msgid "That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand."
msgstr "Ang file na iyon ay na-export mula sa ibang plugin (%s), kaya ang pag-import nito rito ay mag-iimbak ng mga setting na hindi nauunawaan ng plugin na ito."

#. translators: %d: how many settings were imported.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-admin-ui.php:1233
#, php-format
msgid "%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again."
msgid_plural "%d settings imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again."
msgstr[0] "Na-import ang %d setting. Ang mga password at API key ay hindi kailanman isinasama sa export, kaya pakilagay muli ang mga ito."
msgstr[1] "Na-import ang %d (na) setting. Ang mga password at API key ay hindi kailanman isinasama sa pag-export, kaya pakilagay muli ang mga ito."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:58
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "Konektado"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:60
msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "Kumokonekta…"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:62
msgid "Connected, but something needs attention"
msgstr "Konektado, ngunit may kailangang pansinin"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:64
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "Hindi konektado"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:66
msgid "Running on your own account"
msgstr "Tumatakbo sa iyong sariling account"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:68
msgid "We could not check this"
msgstr "Hindi namin ito masuri"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:93
msgid "This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look."
msgstr "Hindi sinabi ng plugin na ito kung bakit. Magpadala ng ulat ng diagnostics at susuriin namin."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:161
msgid "Connection status"
msgstr "Katayuan ng koneksyon"

#. translators: %s: a human-readable interval such as "5 minutes".
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:189
#, php-format
msgid "Last checked %s ago."
msgstr "Huling tiningnan noong %s ang nakalipas."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-connection.php:251
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(bubuksan sa isang bagong tab)"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:199
msgid "Send this to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Ipadala ito sa suporta ng Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:201
msgid "This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it."
msgstr "Ito mismo ang ipapadala — wala nang iba, at walang nakatago. Ang iyong mga password, token at API key ay wala rito."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:204
msgid "The diagnostics report that will be sent"
msgstr "Ang ulat ng mga diagnostic na ipapadala"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:207
msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "Kopyahin sa clipboard"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:214
msgid "Send this report to Zinn® support"
msgstr "Ipadala ang ulat na ito sa suporta ng Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:216
msgid "We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself."
msgstr "Binubuksan namin ang isang support ticket para sa iyo at sumasagot sa pamamagitan ng email. Kung mas gusto mong huwag itong ipadala, kopyahin ito sa itaas at i-paste ito sa isang ticket nang mag-isa."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:228
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Nakopya na"

#. translators: %s: the transport error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:274
#, php-format
msgid "We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong."
msgstr "Hindi namin maabot ang Zinn Digital® mula sa server na ito (%s). Kopyahin ang ulat sa itaas at magbukas na lang ng ticket — walang mali sa iyong mga setting."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:288
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email."
msgstr "Nakuha na ng suporta ng Zinn® ang iyong ulat at sasagot sila sa pamamagitan ng email."

#. translators: %s: the support reference for the report just sent.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:291
#, php-format
msgid "Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email."
msgstr "Natanggap na ng Zinn® support ang iyong ulat — sanggunian %s — at tutugon sila sa pamamagitan ng email."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:300
msgid "You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive."
msgstr "Nagpadala ka ng ilang ulat sa loob ng maikling panahon. Maghintay ng ilang minuto at subukang muli — nakarating naman ang mga nauna."

#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:307
msgid "Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket."
msgstr "Hindi matanggap ng Zinn Digital® ang ulat sa sandaling ito — problema namin ito, hindi sa iyo. Subukang muli makalipas ang ilang sandali, o kopyahin ang ulat sa itaas patungo sa isang tiket."

#. translators: %d: the HTTP status code the server returned.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-diagnostics.php:315
#, php-format
msgid "The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number."
msgstr "Tinanggihan ang ulat (HTTP %d). Kopyahin ito sa itaas at magbukas ng tiket, banggitin ang numerong iyon."

#. translators: %s: the Zinn Digital trade mark, which is not translated.
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:241
#: includes/class-zinn-reseller-promo.php:299
#, php-format
